'''Healer''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that could be obtained when clearing [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event#Merc Storia: Inferno|Merc Storia: Inferno]] or any stage in [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event#Merc Storia: Showdown|Merc Storia: Showdown]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 3.8 Update|Version 3.8]] grants [[Area Attack]]s.

