==Trivia==
*Healer gained the [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] target in [[Version 2.9.1 Update|Version 2.9.1]]. Typically this happens in the same update as the trait is introduced, but Angel was added in [[Version 2.7 Update|Version 2.7]].
*Aside from units which don't attack, Healer has the second lowest DPS of all Cat Units, behind the Ancient Eggs.
*The description of his Evolved Form says that he has a small chance to freeze enemies, despite having a 100% chance to do so.

